# Fact Knowledge Layer - optional configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and edit. Nothing here is required: with
# no .env the system runs entirely locally on the default GGUF model.
#   cp env.example .env
# or run a helper:  ./scripts/setup-gemini.sh   |   ./scripts/setup-groq.sh
#
# A real environment variable always overrides the matching line here.

# A cloud backend is ~100x faster than local CPU (full corpus in seconds). Pick
# ONE. The pipeline is resumable, so hitting a free-tier per-minute rate limit
# just pauses it - no harm.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A: Gemini - Google AI Studio. Free key, NO credit card. (recommended)
#
#   1. Open https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  and sign in with a Google account.
#   2. "Create API key" -> copy it.
#   3. Uncomment the three lines below, paste the key, save as .env
#   4. Check:  python run.py status   (backend line should say "gemini")
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_BACKEND=gemini
# GEMINI_API_KEY=replace_me
# FKL_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option B: Groq - https://console.groq.com -> "API Keys" -> "Create API Key".
# Key starts with `gsk_`. Fast per call, but the free tier's output-tokens-per-
# minute cap is low, so a cold full-corpus run throttles to a crawl (fine for
# incremental uploads). Groq rotates its model catalogue - if the model below
# 404s, list current ones:
#   python -c "from groq import Groq; print([m.id for m in Groq().models.list().data])"
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_BACKEND=groq
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_replace_me
# FKL_GROQ_MODEL=qwen/qwen3.8-27b

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local backend tuning (only relevant when LLM_BACKEND is unset or "local")
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Force CPU even on a CUDA/Metal build (0), or cap offloaded layers (N).
# FKL_N_GPU_LAYERS=0

# Deterministic, no-model extraction - guarantees the pipeline runs anywhere.
# LLM_BACKEND=none
